  "prefLabel": "Env-Wq 1113.03 Hydraulic Design",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wq 1113.03 Hydraulic Design. Hydraulic design for therapy pools shall be in accordance with Env-Wq 1109.03 through Env-Wq 1109.06.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 at chapter heading for Env-Wq 1100) #8468, eff 11-1-05; ss by #10577, eff 5-1-14 (See Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Env-Wq 1100); ss by #13198, eff 5-1-21 (see Revision Note #3 at chapter heading for Env-Wq 1100) (formerly Env-Wq 1110.03)",
